==Latin==

===Alternative forms===
* [[nec-]]

===Etymology===
The word {{term|ne|nē|lang=la}} in compositions.

===Prefix===
{{head|la|prefix}}

# [[absolutely]] [[negate]]s the principal meaning
#: {{term|ne-|'''ne-'''|not|lang=la}} + {{term|scio||I know|lang=la}} → {{term|nescio|'''ne'''scio|I '''don't''' know|lang=la}}

====Quotations====
"[[Nomen]] [[nescio]]." ([[N.N.]]) - I don't know the name, [[John Doe]]

